/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791992009476_9976.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:33:31"},"opinion":{"content":"I think Xu Xiake is a great traveller. I like him because he loved nature and travelled a lot. I can learn to protect nature like him.","comment":"太棒啦！这三句完全符合题目要求，语法都正确，用词贴合主题，句子通顺清晰哦！你准确表达了对徐霞客的看法，能看出很好地理解了题目，继续保持这种认真的态度，作业完成得超棒，加油呀！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791992039744_6885.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:34:01"}},{"reading":{"answers":[{"num":1,"studentAnswer":"travellers","correct":true,"reference":"travellers"},{"num":2,"studentAnswer":"travelling","correct":false,"reference":"nature"},{"num":3,"studentAnswer":"mountains and rivers","correct":true,"reference":"mountains and rivers"},{"num":4,"studentAnswer":"see","correct":true,"reference":"see"},{"num":5,"studentAnswer":"22","correct":false,"reference":"21"},{"num":6,"studentAnswer":"loved","correct":false,"reference":"visited"},{"num":7,"studentAnswer":"sad","correct":false,"reference":"angry"},{"num":8,"studentAnswer":"protect","correct":false,"reference":"take care of"},{"num":9,"studentAnswer":"30","correct":true,"reference":"30"},{"num":10,"studentAnswer":"happy","correct":true,"reference":"happy"}],"comment":"你完成得很认真哦！答对了第1、3、4、9、10空，基础掌握不错。现在看需要调整的地方：第2空你写了travelling，正确答案是nature，这里表达“对自然感兴趣”哦，不是旅行；第5空记错了，徐霞客是21岁开始旅行，不是22；第6空要用visited表示“游览”，你写的loved不符合标准答案要求；第7空别人破坏自然，徐霞客是“生气”（angry）不是难过（sad）；第8空正确短语是take care of，你写的protect不符合要求。多留意细节就会进步更快，继续加油！","imageUrl":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/8888cheng/xu-xiake-homework/main/photos/1791992007288_6030.jpg","time":"2026/10/14 23:33:29"}}]}}}